 "note": "Lines 1-49 continue the Lunenburg High School 2010-2011 roster begun on page 46 (same departments and staff), so school is high although the page prints no school name. Two columns of bare names under department headings (Math/Language Arts line 1; Science line 7 and Social Studies line 8, printed on separate lines; Unified Arts beside McQuaid line 16; Foreign Language beside Pukaite line 17; Special Services beside McCauliff line 25; Guidance beside Stephanie Powers line 31; Tutors/Aides beside Hebert line 33; Cafeteria beside Curtis line 39; Custodians beside Rogers line 46). A name alone on a line while both lists run cannot be placed in a column from the text, so grade_or_dept is empty: Kay Hillman (15), Sandy Laserte (24), Phil McMurray (34), Kate Szocik (38), Kim Melanson (44), Ann Maureen Pliska (45), Brian Sanders (49); Darlene Steele (26) and Peter McCauliff AD (25) have no heading of their own. Line 28 'Media Specialist' labels Pamela Vallee on line 29 (headings). Line 37 'Secretary' is the wrapped end of 'Guidance Secretary' on line 36 (ignored). Printed twice and recorded twice as printed: Kay Hillman (15, 18), Peter McCauliff (13, 25), Courtney Ball (14, 42). Line 50 is the page number."
